# MESSAGE: gymact-capability-schema-pack required-facts gate. Every gymact
# MESSAGE: capability (sosa:Procedure, per gymact's own <urn:gymact:shape:capability>
# MESSAGE: SHACL shape in ~/gymact/src/gymact/ontology/profile.shacl.ttl) classified
# MESSAGE: dct:type <urn:gymact:consequence:do> -- a "does something" capability, per
# MESSAGE: gymact's own consequence-classification vocabulary -- must be the
# MESSAGE: gcs:payloadShapeOf target of at least one gcs:CapabilityPayloadShape. This is
# MESSAGE: the gate closing the actual gap: a DO capability with no declared payload
# MESSAGE: shape means its actuate() payload dict is documented only as free text inside
# MESSAGE: Capability.title (see ontology.ttl's header comment), never machine-checkable.
# MESSAGE: A READ capability is not required to declare a payload shape -- gymact's own
# MESSAGE: Environment.observe()/checkpoint() protocol methods for READ-classified
# MESSAGE: capabilities take no payload argument, so requiring one here would be a false
# MESSAGE: positive, not a real gap.
# MESSAGE: Every gcs:CapabilityPayloadShape must also declare >=1 sh:property (a payload
# MESSAGE: shape with none renders an empty, useless Pydantic model -- a template can
# MESSAGE: only ever emit `pass` for it, never a real field) and exactly one
# MESSAGE: gcs:payloadShapeOf (a shape that names no capability cannot be joined against
# MESSAGE: one by the template's `properties` query, and silently renders as orphaned
# MESSAGE: dead code no consumer capability ever references).
# MESSAGE: Any row = a subject missing the bound property. All patterns are typed with
# MESSAGE: gcs:/sosa:/sh: classes, so this gate is namespace-scoped and composes with
# MESSAGE: other packs' graphs (including gymact's own gymact-registry-pack) without
# MESSAGE: cross-firing.
PREFIX gcs:  <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/gymact-capability-schema#>
PREFIX sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX dct:  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
SELECT ?s ?missing WHERE {
  {
    ?s a sosa:Procedure ; dct:type <urn:gymact:consequence:do> .
    BIND(gcs:payloadShapeOf AS ?missing)
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?shape gcs:payloadShapeOf ?s }
  } UNION {
    ?s a gcs:CapabilityPayloadShape .
    BIND(sh:property AS ?missing)
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?s sh:property ?p }
  } UNION {
    ?s a gcs:CapabilityPayloadShape .
    BIND(gcs:payloadShapeOf AS ?missing)
    FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?s gcs:payloadShapeOf ?cap }
  }
}
ORDER BY ?s ?missing
